***REMOVED*** Grafana Cloud Configuration for NextWatch
***REMOVED*** Copy this to .env and fill in your actual credentials

***REMOVED*** Grafana Cloud Metrics (Prometheus)
GRAFANA_CLOUD_METRICS_URL=https://prometheus-prod-XX-XX-X.grafana.net/api/prom/push
GRAFANA_CLOUD_METRICS_USERNAME=your-metrics-username
GRAFANA_CLOUD_METRICS_PASSWORD=your-metrics-api-key

***REMOVED*** Grafana Cloud Logs (Loki)  
GRAFANA_CLOUD_LOGS_URL=https://logs-prod-XX-XX-X.grafana.net/loki/api/v1/push
GRAFANA_CLOUD_LOGS_USERNAME=your-logs-username
GRAFANA_CLOUD_LOGS_PASSWORD=your-logs-api-key

***REMOVED*** Optional: Grafana Cloud Traces (Tempo) - for future use
GRAFANA_CLOUD_TRACES_URL=https://tempo-prod-XX-XX-X.grafana.net:443
GRAFANA_CLOUD_TRACES_USERNAME=your-traces-username
GRAFANA_CLOUD_TRACES_PASSWORD=your-traces-api-key